From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Burke Cates <burke.cates@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 00:13:27 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 20/22] NOT-FOR-UPSTREAM: clk: qcom: lpasscc-glymur: take laptops-kernel's
 revision

Replace bridge 0008's PENDING Glymur LPASS clock/reset controller with
the version linux-msm laptops-kernel carries (1b6332f0c6cf, 2e3473197e59,
7903de063f4f, f3df43ec5bdb): the audio CSR regmap reaches the WSA3/WSA4
CGCRs at 0x300c/0x301c (max_register 0x3020 instead of 0x1000), and
SWR_TX_CGCR moves to the LPASS CC instance, which the Glymur analog
audio DT (d48341d72ef0) expects.

Assisted-by: Claude Code (Opus 5.5)
---
Not-for-upstream: local workaround for one laptop, not reviewed for
  submission; use only for local testing.

 .../bindings/clock/qcom,sc8280xp-lpasscc.yaml |  7 +++++--
 drivers/clk/qcom/lpasscc-glymur.c             | 20 +++++++++----------
 .../dt-bindings/clock/qcom,glymur-lpasscc.h   | 16 +++++++--------
 3 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/qcom,sc8280xp-lpasscc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/qcom,sc8280xp-lpasscc.yaml
index f235b4e24cc7..b611f1a8b42b 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/qcom,sc8280xp-lpasscc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/qcom,sc8280xp-lpasscc.yaml
@@ -4,22 +4,25 @@
 $id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/clock/qcom,sc8280xp-lpasscc.yaml#
 $schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
 
-title: Qualcomm LPASS Core & Audio Clock Controller on SC8280XP
+title: Qualcomm LPASS Core & Audio Clock Controller on SC8280XP and Glymur
 
 maintainers:
   - Srinivas Kandagatla <srinivas.kandagatla@linaro.org>
 
 description: |
   Qualcomm LPASS core and audio clock control module provides the clocks,
-  and reset on SC8280XP.
+  and reset on SC8280XP and Glymur.
 
   See also:
     include/dt-bindings/clock/qcom,lpasscc-sc8280xp.h
+    include/dt-bindings/clock/qcom,glymur-lpasscc.h
 
 properties:
   compatible:
     oneOf:
       - enum:
+          - qcom,glymur-lpassaudiocc
+          - qcom,glymur-lpasscc
           - qcom,sc8280xp-lpassaudiocc
           - qcom,sc8280xp-lpasscc
       - items:
